  "help_message_4": "BLASTQR file transfers work completely offline.\n\nDue to the nature of the technology BLASTQR file transfers are slow (peaking at around 40kB/s). I recommend transferring small files or compressing them in advance.\n\nFor higher speeds you can play with the 'Chunk length' setting in the Settings screen of the sending device. A higher value can result in higher speeds but not all devices might be able to handle it.\n\nYou can also use BLASTQR to scan regular QR codes.",
